{"obsah":"<p>We held our club's traditional day camp in Tehov. 30 young male and female bikers could play with us on bikes every day from morning to evening. From basic technique to the pump track, jumps and trails in the area. Kája Bedrníková, Štěpán Holý, Marek Tryner and Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček put the boys and girls through their paces as instructors and hopefully took their skills a little higher again. The facilities were looked after by Lucka Doláková and Lenka Kabeláčová, to whom big thanks are due.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_5792.heic?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_5792.heic?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248424\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_5800.heic?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_5800.heic?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248423\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_5781.heic?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_5781.heic?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248425\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_5740.heic?alt=media